
<section id="our-purpose"
         class="about-mission"
         aria-labelledby="mission-title">
    <div class="about-section-label">
        <span class="about-index">01</span>
        <span>OUR PURPOSE</span>
    </div>

    <div class="mission-content">
        <h2 id="mission-title">
            Make the process clearer, so you can focus on the opportunity.
        </h2>

        <div class="mission-details">
            <p>
                ReviewDeck exists to help job seekers bring their applications,
                progress, and important job details into one organized space.
                The goal is simple: less confusion about where things stand,
                and more clarity about what deserves attention next.
            </p>

            <p>
                A job search can feel overwhelming when information is scattered
                across browser tabs, messages, documents, and notes. ReviewDeck
                aims to turn those separate pieces into a process you can follow
                with greater confidence.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
